        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "χT = 83.7 cm3 K mol−1 at 300 K (expected 85.0 for six diamagnetic CoIII and six DyIII), nearly constant to 50 K then falling to 38.3 at 2.0 K, indicating dominant Dy–Dy antiferromagnetic interactions plus anisotropy/thermal depopulation. Frequency-dependent ac susceptibility under 1000 Oe dc field shows SMM behaviour; Cole–Cole α = 0.25 (4.2 K)–0.37 (2.0 K). Fit of τ−1 = CT^n + τ0−1 exp(−Ueff/kBT) + B gives C = 34.4 K−3 (n = 2.99), B = 1069 s−1, τ0 = 8.5×10−7 s and Ueff = 20.8 K.",
